{"text": "Early in the morning, the woman woke the children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Get up, We are going into the forest to get wood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She gave each child a small piece of bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As they walked, Hansel kept stopping and looking back at the house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was secretly dropping the white pebbles on the path. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the middle of the forest, the father made a big fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Rest here, said the woman, We will come back for you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children sat by the fire and ate their bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They heard an axe, so they thought their father was near. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But it was only a branch, and the wind was knocking it against a tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the moon rose, they followed the shining pebbles all the way home.", "alignment": {"characters": ["E", "a", "r", "l", "y", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "o", "k", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "G", "e", "t", " ", "u", "p", ",", " ", "W", "e", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "g", "o", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "r", "e", "s", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "g", "e", "t", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "g", "a", "v", "e", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "p", "i", "e", "c", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "b", "r", "e", "a", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e